, dates, or stats only when absolutely necessary."},"9f803a89d86ed2deb7bd8351c85c65d1a010a18a3f3b20f373d081b850d7ba34":{"file":"audio/9f803a89d86ed2deb7bd8351c85c65d1a010a18a3f3b20f373d081b850d7ba34.opus","dur":1.875,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.3,0.512],[0.512,0.637],[0.637,0.8],[0.8,1.775]],"approx":false,"text":"Not when they're interesting."},"9bfa7f255622ffbd58caa878a6f2bfb40c8e736b205d8d419d5b9031f27ce7d0":{"file":"audio/9bfa7f255622ffbd58caa878a6f2bfb40c8e736b205d8d419d5b9031f27ce7d0.opus","dur":1.775,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.3,0.512],[0.512,0.637],[0.637,0.75],[0.75,1.025],[1.025,1.675]],"approx":false,"text":"Not when you liked them."},"3c5120035033ee001f95e6a21f612fc0d5b4f639e28b62740bf6844cca91065c":{"file":"audio/3c5120035033ee001f95e6a21f612fc0d5b4f639e28b62740bf6844cca91065c.opus","dur":4.025,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.3,0.588],[0.588,0.713],[0.713,0.8],[0.8,1.137],[1.137,1.9],[1.9,2.263],[2.263,2.4],[2.4,2.938],[2.938,3.25],[3.25,3.925]],"approx":false,"text":"Only when the piece genuinely cannot be understood without them."},"4540a7b3ca7ce177c94ab8495a30af828d8a9dc689f929614b9d7959e97ab0e5":{"file":"audio/4540a7b3ca7ce177c94ab8495a30af828d8a9dc689f929614b9d7959e97ab0e5.opus","dur":1.75,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.3,0.412],[0.412,0.525],[0.525,0.85],[0.85,1.0],[1.0,1.65]],"approx":false,"text":"Let me pause you here."},"87f9a0e726a18f1ff2ba20ccb891c02278f16240246441787b754e66efd51059":{"file":"audio/87f9a0e726a18f1ff2ba20ccb891c02278f16240246441787b754e66efd51059.opus","dur":10.525,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.388],[0.388,0.487],[0.487,0.925],[0.925,1.163],[1.163,1.262],[1.262,1.938],[1.938,2.125],[2.125,2.45],[2.45,2.587],[2.587,2.9],[2.9,3.225],[3.225,3.388],[3.388,3.475],[3.475,4.175],[4.175,4.325],[4.325,4.713],[4.713,5.225],[5.225,5.325],[5.325,5.463],[5.463,5.775],[5.775,6.25],[6.25,6.388],[6.388,6.475],[6.475,7.375],[7.375,7.575],[7.575,7.838],[7.838,8.225],[8.225,8.363],[8.363,8.45],[8.45,8.775],[8.775,8.975],[8.975,9.2],[9.2,9.55],[9.55,10.425]],"approx":false,"text":"If a student writes a summary that lists the main points out of order and also tosses in a fun anecdote from the text, how many rules from the notes has that student broken?"},"10690a8f6348b92b309c5914ba642ce2afaeabc4c124943bca76cb2a12d162bb":{"file":"audio/10690a8f6348b92b309c5914ba642ce2afaeabc4c124943bca76cb2a12d162bb.opus","dur":1.975,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.3,0.487],[0.487,0.775],[0.775,0.9],[0.9,1.012],[1.012,1.075],[1.075,1.875]],"approx":false,"text":"Think about it for a second."},"2c503bd5e25c457cec5c42b7b8eb3522c7445122bf77f933bf9758d9007d2905":{"file":"audio/2c503bd5e25c457cec5c42b7b8eb3522c7445122bf77f933bf9758d9007d2905.opus","dur":4.075,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.388],[0.388,0.75],[0.75,0.912],[0.912,1.525],[1.525,1.675],[1.675,1.975],[1.975,2.3],[2.3,2.413],[2.413,2.5],[2.5,3.25],[3.25,3.975]],"approx":false,"text":"The answer is two: the order rule and the no-anecdotes rule."},"3897afd463caa4afd25c786dd474a2893a850235d963a7c3a54ccbf83e4f59ec":{"file":"audio/3897afd463caa4afd25c786dd474a2893a850235d963a7c3a54ccbf83e4f59ec.opus","dur":3.4,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.512],[0.512,0.85],[0.85,1.788],[1.788,2.062],[2.062,2.3],[2.3,3.3]],"approx":false,"text":"Two separate violations, one short paragraph."},"66ff982739326652fb467ade4f4c9d126655807c6ee6f0b5cdeba9da7c8adf29":{"file":"audio/66ff982739326652fb467ade4f4c9d126655807c6ee6f0b5cdeba9da7c8adf29.opus","dur":6.75,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.4],[0.4,0.725],[0.725,0.938],[0.938,1.038],[1.038,1.525],[1.525,1.775],[1.775,2.362],[2.362,2.575],[2.575,3.4],[3.4,3.513],[3.513,3.65],[3.65,4.175],[4.175,4.287],[4.287,4.425],[4.425,5.1],[5.1,5.463],[5.463,5.85],[5.85,6.65]],"approx":false,"text":"Your notes break a summary into exactly two parts, and this structure is your skeleton every single time."},"304deb304cdf69dbdac65fe5727708ca66f2692838e01072f258aa8254acf2cd":{"file":"audio/304deb304cdf69dbdac65fe5727708ca66f2692838e01072f258aa8254acf2cd.opus","dur":2.5,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.5],[0.5,0.887],[0.887,1.038],[1.038,1.125],[1.125,1.5],[1.5,2.4]],"approx":false,"text":"Part one is the topic sentence."},"b1dc8e99869269def21e706586a878743041e935ca20979a75ed034dab32dc01":{"file":"audio/b1dc8e99869269def21e706586a878743041e935ca20979a75ed034dab32dc01.opus","dur":2.925,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.537],[0.537,1.025],[1.025,1.188],[1.188,1.275],[1.275,1.762],[1.762,2.825]],"approx":false,"text":"Part two is the supporting information."},"c737f3ae166656aa782de1bd1e771c37f6ec1e810e32806b4adcb6120f67ffda":{"file":"audio/c737f3ae166656aa782de1bd1e771c37f6ec1e810e32806b4adcb6120f67ffda.opus","dur":2.875,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.325],[0.325,0.7],[0.7,1.25],[1.25,1.413],[1.413,1.475],[1.475,1.975],[1.975,2.775]],"approx":false,"text":"The topic sentence has a specific job."},"788ca139af88c1ed08989495d1cae1588d97a61782e92cd287f348378fef07a2":{"file":"audio/788ca139af88c1ed08989495d1cae1588d97a61782e92cd287f348378fef07a2.opus","dur":5.375,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.375],[0.375,1.05],[1.05,1.15],[1.15,1.45],[1.45,1.625],[1.625,1.887],[1.887,1.988],[1.988,2.475],[2.475,2.587],[2.587,2.7],[2.7,3.475],[3.475,3.587],[3.587,3.675],[3.675,4.025],[4.025,4.338],[4.338,4.425],[4.425,5.275]],"approx":false,"text":"It identifies the work by giving the title and the author, and it also names the genre."},"13dfd02475bf6db163f386d7d3c129af0d1acf52f17cc5f5c48ad15dc53d1722":{"file":"audio/13dfd02475bf6db163f386d7d3c129af0d1acf52f17cc5f5c48ad15dc53d1722.opus","dur":8.325,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.588],[0.588,0.825],[0.825,1.188],[1.188,1.262],[1.262,2.1],[2.1,2.487],[2.487,2.688],[2.688,2.825],[2.825,3.2],[3.2,4.013],[4.013,4.15],[4.15,4.625],[4.625,4.8],[4.8,5.138],[5.138,5.312],[5.312,5.55],[5.55,5.688],[5.688,6.05],[6.05,6.475],[6.475,6.625],[6.625,6.775],[6.775,7.075],[7.075,7.2],[7.2,7.425],[7.425,8.225]],"approx":false,"text":"That's three pieces of information packed into your opening line, and notice that this is where the reader learns what they're about to hear about."},"0a8dc7b476f6c726d21f24e9f3a2bfa79c745ec4030e788a6a36e79b9092b4f7":{"file":"audio/0a8dc7b476f6c726d21f24e9f3a2bfa79c745ec4030e788a6a36e79b9092b4f7.opus","dur":3.55,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.35],[0.35,0.838],[0.838,1.7],[1.7,1.837],[1.837,1.962],[1.962,2.05],[2.05,2.375],[2.375,2.7],[2.7,3.45]],"approx":false,"text":"The supporting information is where the main points live."},"bc5bd377d4a6402289a4c65e6c9e256afda4642913de6c1a2db0414736d31393":{"file":"audio/bc5bd377d4a6402289a4c65e6c9e256afda4642913de6c1a2db0414736d31393.opus","dur":5.55,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.412],[0.412,0.6],[0.6,0.725],[0.725,1.025],[1.025,2.0],[2.0,2.125],[2.125,2.425],[2.425,2.775],[2.775,2.987],[2.987,3.337],[3.337,3.413],[3.413,3.513],[3.513,3.85],[3.85,4.237],[4.237,4.388],[4.388,4.525],[4.525,5.45]],"approx":false,"text":"And there's a rule attached: the main points must appear in the same order as the original."},"a2baab73afaa138b6d268b4f877bfbc731344e97ce46d139d042972694371b81":{"file":"audio/a2baab73afaa138b6d268b4f877bfbc731344e97ce46d139d042972694371b81.opus","dur":4.225,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.588],[0.588,1.163],[1.163,1.837],[1.837,2.125],[2.125,2.25],[2.25,2.487],[2.487,2.6],[2.6,2.975],[2.975,3.175],[3.175,4.125]],"approx":false,"text":"Don't rearrange things because you found the ending more exciting."},"f9988327779118e89c83b623a67d5bb6c789a33f360c3f6825e98087be0b6c9c":{"file":"audio/f9988327779118e89c83b623a67d5bb6c789a33f360c3f6825e98087be0b6c9c.opus","dur":2.675,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.3,0.588],[0.588,0.675],[0.675,0.963],[0.963,1.113],[1.113,1.475],[1.475,1.825],[1.825,2.575]],"approx":false,"text":"Follow the road the author already built."},"dcf12e9582d928ad50fbac5914db224b9fd2e22bb075e6cb4a51549a972e6bb1":{"file":"audio/dcf12e9582d928ad50fbac5914db224b9fd2e22bb075e6cb4a51549a972e6bb1.opus","dur":8.55,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.537],[0.537,0.662],[0.662,0.762],[0.762,1.188],[1.188,1.625],[1.625,1.863],[1.863,2.25],[2.25,2.825],[2.825,2.913],[2.913,3.0],[3.0,3.525],[3.525,4.013],[4.013,4.338],[4.338,4.438],[4.438,4.525],[4.525,4.9],[4.9,5.775],[5.775,5.938],[5.938,6.463],[6.463,6.625],[6.625,6.763],[6.763,7.1],[7.1,7.438],[7.438,7.513],[7.513,7.6],[7.6,8.45]],"approx":false,"text":"So if a quiz asks which element belongs in the supporting info rather than the topic sentence, the answer is the main points of the text."},"2709688086a026f2cfb924a506545b2c339c7fa4f9bb25353ae78631bbcd9447":{"file":"audio/2709688086a026f2cfb924a506545b2c339c7fa4f9bb25353ae78631bbcd9447.opus","dur":2.925,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.863],[0.863,1.275],[1.275,1.4],[1.4,1.775],[1.775,1.938],[1.938,2.1],[2.1,2.825]],"approx":false,"text":"Title, author, and genre go up front."},"7198568082f187504bc9dcdcef3d7097286fe291d0c88ecc0de37d2cee798b9c":{"file":"audio/7198568082f187504bc9dcdcef3d7097286fe291d0c88ecc0de37d2cee798b9c.opus","dur":2.525,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.3,0.575],[0.575,0.9],[0.9,1.05],[1.05,1.525],[1.525,1.625],[1.625,2.425]],"approx":false,"text":"Main points come after, in order."},"c0ca7c2beabcb9fb257e8952bd08bab825afddfd2ffec92a15e622dea955466f":{"file":"audio/c0ca7c2beabcb9fb257e8952bd08bab825afddfd2ffec92a15e622dea955466f.opus","dur":5.325,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.45],[0.45,0.675],[0.675,1.475],[1.475,1.6],[1.6,1.925],[1.925,2.013],[2.013,2.1],[2.1,2.35],[2.35,2.775],[2.775,3.112],[3.112,3.4],[3.4,3.775],[3.775,4.1],[4.1,4.65],[4.65,5.225]],"approx":false,"text":"Two more rules, and these are the ones students break most often without realizing it."},"3db13b25775364a9302cf1e998bddbf9194af561e7af4fb2a84a83b2b56d4e60":{"file":"audio/3db13b25775364a9302cf1e998bddbf9194af561e7af4fb2a84a83b2b56d4e60.opus","dur":2.25,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.388],[0.388,0.812],[0.812,0.975],[0.975,2.15]],"approx":false,"text":"The first is paraphrasing."},"4e3683901336a2eb48ca09fb13a41f867397e3cef29050463ab948b1905fa235":{"file":"audio/4e3683901336a2eb48ca09fb13a41f867397e3cef29050463ab948b1905fa235.opus","dur":5.575,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.3,0.4],[0.4,0.525],[0.525,1.125],[1.125,1.75],[1.75,2.025],[2.025,2.538],[2.538,2.7],[2.7,2.9],[2.9,3.325],[3.325,4.037],[4.037,4.338],[4.338,4.45],[4.45,4.65],[4.65,5.475]],"approx":false,"text":"In your notes, paraphrase means retelling with no direct quotes, using your own words."},"d7b632f90c9b89487906599e01e5d74b163c0d59acc882114c5fce789977e3dc":{"file":"audio/d7b632f90c9b89487906599e01e5d74b163c0d59acc882114c5fce789977e3dc.opus","dur":3.425,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.3,0.475],[0.475,0.95],[0.95,1.35],[1.35,1.663],[1.663,1.75],[1.75,1.962],[1.962,2.312],[2.312,2.388],[2.388,2.45],[2.45,3.325]],"approx":false,"text":"So no, direct quotes are not allowed in a summary."},"61814faf36f63d43e8f658cc3e7056cf13877fdfe1272fa821c915d746328ab8":{"file":"audio/61814faf36f63d43e8f658cc3e7056cf13877fdfe1272fa821c915d746328ab8.opus","dur":9.075,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.4],[0.4,0.525],[0.525,0.9],[0.9,1.012],[1.012,1.45],[1.45,1.775],[1.775,1.938],[1.938,2.275],[2.275,2.413],[2.413,2.487],[2.487,2.6],[2.6,3.475],[3.475,3.612],[3.612,3.763],[3.763,4.362],[4.362,4.45],[4.45,5.088],[5.088,5.763],[5.763,6.062],[6.062,6.175],[6.175,6.312],[6.312,6.575],[6.575,7.088],[7.088,7.45],[7.45,7.562],[7.562,7.688],[7.688,7.75],[7.75,8.025],[8.025,8.975]],"approx":false,"text":"If you copy a sentence word for word out of the article, you have violated the paraphrase rule, even if you cite it, even if it's a great sentence."},"7cd09c755edeb85d61511ad60f4d1e6fc8e085b3fcc51dad2244f50e97be7026":{"file":"audio/7cd09c755edeb85d61511ad60f4d1e6fc8e085b3fcc51dad2244f50e97be7026.opus","dur":1.75,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.325,0.588],[0.588,0.662],[0.662,1.65]],"approx":false,"text":"Here's an analogy."},"51549cefa21c799d6ce78f08dcd3d79f06f326e7ebbb1439598210630736bfd4":{"file":"audio/51549cefa21c799d6ce78f08dcd3d79f06f326e7ebbb1439598210630736bfd4.opus","dur":7.625,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,1.062],[1.062,1.225],[1.225,1.45],[1.45,1.725],[1.725,1.85],[1.85,2.15],[2.15,2.775],[2.775,2.862],[2.862,2.975],[2.975,3.25],[3.25,3.4],[3.4,4.237],[4.237,4.612],[4.612,4.7],[4.7,5.075],[5.075,5.388],[5.388,5.525],[5.525,6.225],[6.225,6.312],[6.312,6.4],[6.4,6.725],[6.725,7.525]],"approx":false,"text":"Paraphrasing is like giving a friend directions to your house from memory instead of handing them a photograph of the street sign."},"064fa7b25c01782bae79b4937d513fd616c07f81a895c29a503275fc0a9eb8f7":{"file":"audio/064fa7b25c01782bae79b4937d513fd616c07f81a895c29a503275fc0a9eb8f7.opus","dur":2.85,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.362],[0.362,1.137],[1.137,1.288],[1.288,1.425],[1.425,1.95],[1.95,2.75]],"approx":false,"text":"The photograph is the original's words."},"8834e2c4a1eccae05d163b964797dfdbd2538ef8055b2a0e729b87a2dcdc1d1d":{"file":"audio/8834e2c4a1eccae05d163b964797dfdbd2538ef8055b2a0e729b87a2dcdc1d1d.opus","dur":5.75,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.4],[0.4,1.087],[1.087,1.225],[1.225,1.363],[1.363,2.475],[2.475,2.6],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.025],[3.025,3.663],[3.663,3.95],[3.95,4.15],[4.15,4.6],[4.6,4.8],[4.8,4.9],[4.9,5.65]],"approx":false,"text":"Your directions are your understanding, and only your directions prove you actually know the way."},"4e588bdc6916902dfa79997589171e1d7ee9f2636624cfdc133039e26d60861d":{"file":"audio/4e588bdc6916902dfa79997589171e1d7ee9f2636624cfdc133039e26d60861d.opus","dur":2.65,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.388],[0.388,0.725],[0.725,1.188],[1.188,1.35],[1.35,2.55]],"approx":false,"text":"The second rule is objectivity."},"6a653b0fe6a0bf332ae6ffd427cc82946038f91e50fa6b3f79bc71b2b1f148eb":{"file":"audio/6a653b0fe6a0bf332ae6ffd427cc82946038f91e50fa6b3f79bc71b2b1f148eb.opus","dur":2.975,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.85],[0.85,1.175],[1.175,1.425],[1.425,1.837],[1.837,1.913],[1.913,2.0],[2.0,2.875]],"approx":false,"text":"Objective means no opinion in the summary."},"20274789448c58893b0b8681c0bbdccb3396fe9eaab3461bd3d95f5bc822aa37":{"file":"audio/20274789448c58893b0b8681c0bbdccb3396fe9eaab3461bd3d95f5bc822aa37.opus","dur":5.725,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.4],[0.4,0.762],[0.762,1.075],[1.075,1.238],[1.238,1.35],[1.35,1.462],[1.462,1.85],[1.85,2.15],[2.15,2.325],[2.325,2.913],[2.913,3.087],[3.087,3.188],[3.188,3.938],[3.938,4.312],[4.312,4.638],[4.638,4.763],[4.763,4.888],[4.888,5.625]],"approx":false,"text":"Your notes even give you a memory line for it: it's a summary, nobody cares what I think."},"e71038c573da91c3b666eb79bbb219bf550800d015ff9b83a62e3e8a43d0e82e":{"file":"audio/e71038c573da91c3b666eb79bbb219bf550800d015ff9b83a62e3e8a43d0e82e.opus","dur":5.8,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.525],[0.525,0.863],[0.863,1.475],[1.475,1.613],[1.613,1.738],[1.738,1.837],[1.837,2.625],[2.625,2.925],[2.925,3.087],[3.087,3.513],[3.513,3.825],[3.825,4.375],[4.375,4.713],[4.713,5.7]],"approx":false,"text":"That sounds blunt, but it's a gift, because it settles every borderline case instantly."},"9bdf8ac4be860fc699251579f1bf87789ed3ad48c01ab546ae84d6fba93b1f35":{"file":"audio/9bdf8ac4be860fc699251579f1bf87789ed3ad48c01ab546ae84d6fba93b1f35.opus","dur":1.775,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.5],[0.5,0.812],[0.812,0.938],[0.938,1.675]],"approx":false,"text":"Quick pause and think."},"0f1d68d64695f61d1867a19deea9498be60f7fc1a23ccea0db525578805819df":{"file":"audio/0f1d68d64695f61d1867a19deea9498be60f7fc1a23ccea0db525578805819df.opus","dur":3.85,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.35],[0.35,0.7],[0.7,1.375],[1.375,1.538],[1.538,1.875],[1.875,2.038],[2.038,2.188],[2.188,2.55],[2.55,2.788],[2.788,2.875],[2.875,3.75]],"approx":false,"text":"A student writes, I loved how the author ended the chapter."},"fcae3f573bf051bb151cfd2eaab2ddf8b3fe15bedb433374843c9536b6c2601b":{"file":"audio/fcae3f573bf051bb151cfd2eaab2ddf8b3fe15bedb433374843c9536b6c2601b.opus","dur":2.0,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.487],[0.487,0.762],[0.762,0.938],[0.938,1.125],[1.125,1.9]],"approx":false,"text":"Which rule does that break?"},"09be8a6df5f4276c689dad9243e4b07e8fb36061e7011c8d0fc15adb0a544faa":{"file":"audio/09be8a6df5f4276c689dad9243e4b07e8fb36061e7011c8d0fc15adb0a544faa.opus","dur":2.025,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.4],[0.4,0.75],[0.75,1.925]],"approx":false,"text":"It breaks objectivity."},"d0743b2dc5f118e2356fda8dc858c5a0dd43cbee936f93bd33ab16fa76fa17df":{"file":"audio/d0743b2dc5f118e2356fda8dc858c5a0dd43cbee936f93bd33ab16fa76fa17df.opus","dur":6.15,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.375],[0.375,0.713],[0.713,1.163],[1.163,1.288],[1.288,1.387],[1.387,1.875],[1.875,2.875],[2.875,3.0],[3.0,3.6],[3.6,4.037],[4.037,4.112],[4.112,4.175],[4.175,4.875],[4.875,5.062],[5.062,5.138],[5.138,6.05]],"approx":false,"text":"The word loved is a personal reaction, and reactions belong in a review, not a summary."},"f43f1b22db02cfd276559caf34630a970b17a13a069b45252e219b8c385cdf5b":{"file":"audio/f43f1b22db02cfd276559caf34630a970b17a13a069b45252e219b8c385cdf5b.opus","dur":4.625,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.463],[0.463,0.562],[0.562,0.975],[0.975,1.212],[1.212,1.288],[1.288,1.4],[1.4,2.125],[2.125,2.263],[2.263,2.7],[2.7,2.888],[2.888,2.975],[2.975,3.35],[3.35,3.975],[3.975,4.525]],"approx":false,"text":"There's a starred note in your notes, and stars mean the teacher emphasized it."},"b4dfdd94ef74d83919db7b6a3717f83a13c1425b192a7ca6dd910fdd76e4b361":{"file":"audio/b4dfdd94ef74d83919db7b6a3717f83a13c1425b192a7ca6dd910fdd76e4b361.opus","dur":3.325,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.375],[0.375,0.75],[0.75,0.887],[0.887,1.5],[1.5,1.613],[1.613,1.788],[1.788,1.938],[1.938,2.15],[2.15,3.225]],"approx":false,"text":"The warning is simple: do not be too descriptive."},"b98e58514954dd8d4d54b251a433459cebbbfcc189a9a717bf36426d12bb14b7":{"file":"audio/b98e58514954dd8d4d54b251a433459cebbbfcc189a9a717bf36426d12bb14b7.opus","dur":6.575,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.45],[0.45,0.588],[0.588,0.688],[0.688,1.075],[1.075,1.225],[1.225,1.663],[1.663,2.375],[2.375,2.675],[2.675,3.525],[3.525,3.875],[3.875,4.15],[4.15,4.737],[4.737,5.15],[5.15,5.35],[5.35,5.662],[5.662,6.475]],"approx":false,"text":"This is the trap that catches careful, thorough students, because being descriptive feels like being thorough."},"32b307e12d8ccecf3e529ad598629584e1e747546df39a3c33265e812d540b14":{"file":"audio/32b307e12d8ccecf3e529ad598629584e1e747546df39a3c33265e812d540b14.opus","dur":6.325,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.388],[0.388,0.738],[0.738,1.15],[1.15,1.7],[1.7,2.188],[2.188,2.425],[2.425,2.712],[2.712,2.8],[2.8,3.775],[3.775,3.9],[3.9,4.612],[4.612,4.787],[4.787,5.075],[5.075,5.175],[5.175,6.225]],"approx":false,"text":"But every extra descriptive detail chips away at concise, and concise is half the definition."},"0c747aaa4233407df70556361299060d684003127392799f372bb8398e61599c":{"file":"audio/0c747aaa4233407df70556361299060d684003127392799f372bb8398e61599c.opus","dur":1.725,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.4,0.675],[0.675,1.625]],"approx":false,"text":"Let's recap."},"9e3286f375f9740282fff4fb27240ea8914b91cac3845cda3d6846fb334a2d32":{"file":"audio/9e3286f375f9740282fff4fb27240ea8914b91cac3845cda3d6846fb334a2d32.opus","dur":9.025,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.362],[0.362,0.863],[0.863,0.988],[0.988,1.1],[1.1,1.525],[1.525,1.65],[1.65,2.15],[2.15,2.65],[2.65,2.737],[2.737,2.837],[2.837,3.2],[3.2,3.35],[3.35,4.125],[4.125,4.237],[4.237,4.325],[4.325,4.513],[4.513,4.987],[4.987,5.075],[5.075,5.725],[5.725,5.888],[5.888,6.375],[6.375,6.525],[6.525,7.237],[7.237,7.362],[7.362,7.463],[7.463,8.037],[8.037,8.2],[8.2,8.925]],"approx":false,"text":"A summary is a clear and concise retelling of a text or work, and you can summarize a movie, an article or essay, or a chapter or book."},"3986dd3d7b6c9edcb2b20f69b855f400fce560c1c0e9f19d5bc083ea873bb086":{"file":"audio/3986dd3d7b6c9edcb2b20f69b855f400fce560c1c0e9f19d5bc083ea873bb086.opus","dur":4.675,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.375],[0.375,0.613],[0.613,0.988],[0.988,1.075],[1.075,1.375],[1.375,1.975],[1.975,2.075],[2.075,2.462],[2.462,2.575],[2.575,3.15],[3.15,3.263],[3.263,3.35],[3.35,3.587],[3.587,3.737],[3.737,4.575]],"approx":false,"text":"It must include the main points, the title and author, and it must be brief."},"dc2ab39908f2216d73cda4b8f1eb819dd8186ba374cab394f2bd9adb42b916db":{"file":"audio/dc2ab39908f2216d73cda4b8f1eb819dd8186ba374cab394f2bd9adb42b916db.opus","dur":5.925,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.375],[0.375,0.512],[0.512,0.925],[0.925,1.5],[1.5,2.112],[2.112,2.587],[2.587,2.7],[2.7,3.675],[3.675,4.075],[4.075,4.75],[4.75,5.825]],"approx":false,"text":"It should exclude numbers, dates, stats, and anecdotes, unless absolutely necessary."},"86b5bd3e314af68747b057d81fa736c7af7713c2ee867d9b113af8bc08ef6ab9":{"file":"audio/86b5bd3e314af68747b057d81fa736c7af7713c2ee867d9b113af8bc08ef6ab9.opus","dur":10.625,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.975],[0.975,1.125],[1.125,1.312],[1.312,1.413],[1.413,1.85],[1.85,2.3],[2.3,2.812],[2.812,2.913],[2.913,3.625],[3.625,3.788],[3.788,4.662],[4.662,4.787],[4.787,4.875],[4.875,5.85],[5.85,6.075],[6.075,6.588],[6.588,7.287],[7.287,7.562],[7.562,7.662],[7.662,7.975],[7.975,8.375],[8.375,8.463],[8.463,8.562],[8.562,8.9],[8.9,9.287],[9.287,9.438],[9.438,9.575],[9.575,10.525]],"approx":false,"text":"Structurally, you write a topic sentence containing the title, the author, and the genre, then supporting information giving the main points in the same order as the original."},"233a86258d3e75553217192f607cb35ce302e375bcc966c8f4f79f7e6b3b6bcb":{"file":"audio/233a86258d3e75553217192f607cb35ce302e375bcc966c8f4f79f7e6b3b6bcb.opus","dur":6.675,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.275,0.775],[0.775,1.012],[1.012,1.163],[1.163,1.837],[1.837,1.913],[1.913,2.05],[2.05,2.3],[2.3,2.7],[2.7,2.888],[2.888,3.125],[3.125,3.55],[3.55,4.35],[4.35,4.513],[4.513,5.05],[5.05,5.275],[5.275,5.525],[5.525,6.575]],"approx":false,"text":"Everything must be paraphrased in your own words with no direct quotes, and everything must stay objective."},"a1438428b3193bf3c2cfc7c8862c356fff028c49b21cbce0dd88ba296c1239c6":{"file":"audio/a1438428b3193bf3c2cfc7c8862c356fff028c49b21cbce0dd88ba296c1239c6.opus","dur":6.3,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.25,0.362],[0.362,0.475],[0.475,0.85],[0.85,0.988],[0.988,1.262],[1.262,1.337],[1.337,1.475],[1.475,1.637],[1.637,2.212],[2.212,2.475],[2.475,2.675],[2.675,2.875],[2.875,3.737],[3.737,3.913],[3.913,4.013],[4.013,4.65],[4.65,5.0],[5.0,5.263],[5.263,5.388],[5.388,5.513],[5.513,6.2]],"approx":false,"text":"When you're tempted to slip in what you thought, just hear that line: it's a summary, nobody cares what I think."},"134b7bdcc5ed5480886708c6b04b2a37fa29ffe641ee380624003f92032612ed":{"file":"audio/134b7bdcc5ed5480886708c6b04b2a37fa29ffe641ee380624003f92032612ed.opus","dur":3.8,"voice":"af_heart","words":[[0.325,0.625],[0.625,1.05],[1.05,1.163],[1.163,1.3],[1.3,1.712],[1.712,2.025],[2.025,2.475],[2.475,2.587],[2.587,2.737],[2.737,3.7]],"approx":false,"text":"Nail those and you'll handle every question on this material."}}}